            "text": "{\"endstack\":39925,\"hcards\":\"thtd\",\"hh\":\"Game #2333010858: Table \\u20ac100 NL - 0.50/1.00 - No Limit Hold'Em - 20:43:38 2025/12/07\\n*** Seated players ***\\nSeat 1: BLABLABLA2 (\\u20ac66.36)\\nSeat 2: BLUEWHALEy (\\u20ac223.06)\\nSeat 3: Jan169169 (\\u20ac177.69)\\nSeat 4: howtobluff72 (\\u20ac119.02)\\nSeat 5: allthejuice (\\u20ac100)\\nSeat 6: 123goooooooo (\\u20ac108.40)\\n*** Blinds and button ***\\nhowtobluff72 has the button\\nallthejuice posts small blind \\u20ac0.50\\n123goooooooo posts big blind \\u20ac1\\n*** Hole cards ***\\nDealt in allthejuice\\nDealt in 123goooooooo\\nDealt in BLABLABLA2\\nDealt to BLUEWHALEy [Th Td]\\nDealt to Jan169169 [Ad 5c]\\nDealt in howtobluff72\\n*** Preflop ***\\nBLABLABLA2 folds\\nBLUEWHALEy raises \\u20ac2.30 to \\u20ac2.30\\nJan169169 calls \\u20ac2.30\\nhowtobluff72 folds\\nallthejuice folds\\n123goooooooo folds\\n*** Flop *** [3d 9s 5s]\\nBLUEWHALEy checks\\nJan169169 bets \\u20ac4.75\\nBLUEWHALEy raises \\u20ac18.50 to \\u20ac18.50\\nJan169169 raises \\u20ac27.50 to \\u20ac32.25\\nBLUEWHALEy raises \\u20ac202.26 to \\u20ac220.76, and is all-in\\nJan169169 calls \\u20ac143.14, and is all-in\\nUncalled bet returned to BLUEWHALEy: \\u20ac45.37\\n*** Showdown ***\\n*** Turn *** [3d 9s 5s] [2c]\\n*** River *** [3d 9s 5s] [2c] [7s]\\nBLUEWHALEy shows [Th Td], A Pair of Tens\\nJan169169 shows [Ad 5c], A Pair of Fives\\nBLUEWHALEy wins \\u20ac353.88\\n*** Summary ***\\nTotal pot \\u20ac356.88 Rake \\u20ac3\\nSeat 2: BLUEWHALEy: bet \\u20ac223.06 and won \\u20ac399.25, net result: \\u20ac176.19\\nSeat 3: Jan169169: bet \\u20ac177.69 and won \\u20ac0, net result: \\u20ac-177.69\\nSeat 5: allthejuice: bet \\u20ac0.50 and won \\u20ac0, net result: \\u20ac-0.50\\nSeat 6: 123goooooooo: bet \\u20ac1 and won \\u20ac0, net result: \\u20ac-1\\n\",\"hid\":2333010858,\"instance\":\"cg42d8b4\",\"startstack\":22306,\"status\":\"ok\",\"stime\":1765140218,\"totalpot\":35688,\"ts\":1765140271,\"tt\":0}\n"
